      "uid": "zhcn:d740b420b7f812fb1d7448ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦想、理想，或是同学们的期待。\n正因为承担重荷，我才能够变强。\n我相信这一点，但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e27b0f4a9b2be2e21a70b45d753e83eed155fde370860fab53ee0887e7af8230",
