      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……话虽如此，我还需要多多学习，\n那不是现在的我该追求的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c24d71be1581b47543e184865e8b424504c12981fa5cc57500b48fb60356ad3c",
