      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正在追求理想的她，\n纵使有机会与丸善斯基一战，\n也会选择表现出“皇帝”该有的样貌吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a68d51a6df299631d30a21891a655ba585338f2d0beb7867bc7e168326e5332b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
